<title>UK: Partco buys Dana unit, sets rights.</title>
<headline>Partco buys Dana unit, sets rights.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British independent car and commercial vehicle parts distributor Partco Group plc said on Thursday it had agreed to purchase Dana Distribution Europe from the U.S. components giant Dana Corp for 103 million stg.</p>
<p>The acquisition will be funded in part by a fully underwritten one-for-two rights issue at 300p per share to raise 68.8 million stg net of expenses, with the balance being funded by bank borrowings and cash, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
